    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουκῐνίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow the trumpet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόμβοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					6.24
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῡκᾰνίζω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βου-ῐνίζω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1321.33
			</span></i>, etc.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουκῐνάτωρ</span></b> ,
